<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>FAQs - KNC 2026</title>
  <style>
    body{margin:0;font-family:Segoe UI,Tahoma,Verdana,sans-serif;background:#f6f8fb}
    .wrap{display:flex;min-height:100vh}
    .sidebar{width:260px;background:#0f1b3d;color:#fff;padding:18px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .brand{font-weight:700;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:10px}
    .nav{display:block;color:#dbe3ff;text-decoration:none;padding:12px 12px;border-radius:10px}
    .nav:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08)}
    .nav.active{background:rgba(255,215,0,.18);color:#ffd700}
    .nav.danger{color:#ffbdbd}
    .main{flex:1;padding:24px}
    .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid #e7ecf5;border-radius:16px;padding:18px;max-width:900px}
    details{border:1px solid #eef2f6;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff}
    summary{cursor:pointer;font-weight:800;color:#0f1b3d}
    .muted{color:#667085}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <%- include('partials/dashboard-sidebar', { activeTab }) %>

  <div class="main">
    <h2 style="margin:0 0 14px 0;color:#0f1b3d">FAQs</h2>
    <div class="card">
      <details open>
        <summary>Is my money refundable?</summary>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">
          Please check our Refund Policy page. In general, refunds depend on contest rules and payment status.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>I forgot my password. What should I do?</summary>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">
          Password reset will be added soon. For now, contact support through the “How can I speak to you?” option below.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What is the contest end date?</summary>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">
          Each contest has its own deadline. You can see it in the Dashboard under the registered contest card.
        </div>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How can I speak to you?</summary>
        <div class="muted" style="margin-top:8px">
          Use the Contact page or WhatsApp support (to be added). We’ll also add a support email here shortly.
        </div>
      </details>

      <div class="muted" style="margin-top:12px;font-size:13px">
        We will add more FAQs later.
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
